1
00:00:03,140 --> 00:00:04,700
<i>In this world...</i>

2
00:00:05,340 --> 00:00:10,640
<i>Is the destiny of mankind controlled by some transcendental entity or law?</i>

3
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:14,540
<i>Is it like the hand of God hovering above?</i>

4
00:00:15,550 --> 00:00:17,380
<i>At least it is true...</i>

5
00:00:17,790 --> 00:00:21,370
<i>...that man has no control, even over his own will.</i>

6
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:36,050
What the hell happened?

7
00:01:06,420 --> 00:01:08,500
Feel no shame about shape

8
00:01:08,580 --> 00:01:10,420
Weather changes their phrase

9
00:01:10,540 --> 00:01:14,170
Even mother will show you another way

10
00:01:14,170 --> 00:01:16,550
So put your glasses on

11
00:01:16,630 --> 00:01:18,640
Nothing will be wrong

12
00:01:18,720 --> 00:01:20,850
There's no blame. There's no fame

13
00:01:20,850 --> 00:01:22,680
It's up to you

14
00:01:22,850 --> 00:01:26,310
The first words should be found

15
00:01:26,940 --> 00:01:29,940
Whatever holds you back

16
00:01:30,820 --> 00:01:31,320
I...

17
00:01:31,690 --> 00:01:32,440
...can...

18
00:01:32,530 --> 00:01:34,610
I can get it off

19
00:01:34,610 --> 00:01:35,610
Tell me what...

20
00:01:35,610 --> 00:01:36,610
Tell me what...

21
00:01:36,610 --> 00:01:38,450
Tell me what you want

22
00:01:38,570 --> 00:01:39,530
I don't know why...

23
00:01:39,740 --> 00:01:40,530
Don't know why...

24
00:01:40,530 --> 00:01:42,540
Don't know why you're afraid

25
00:01:42,700 --> 00:01:43,700
Tell me what...

26
00:01:43,790 --> 00:01:44,660
Tell me what...

27
00:01:44,830 --> 00:01:46,330
Tell me what you'd say

28
00:01:46,580 --> 00:01:47,670
I don't know why...

29
00:01:47,790 --> 00:01:48,750
Don't know why...

30
00:01:48,830 --> 00:01:49,540
Too late...

31
00:01:49,630 --> 00:01:51,170
It's too late

32
00:01:56,090 --> 00:02:00,090
The Great Eclipse

33
00:02:09,850 --> 00:02:10,860
What is this?

34
00:02:10,860 --> 00:02:12,480
Where the hell are we?

35
00:02:12,480 --> 00:02:13,520
Hey!

36
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:17,150
Weren't we just riding over grassy plains?

37
00:02:17,150 --> 00:02:20,490
Or were we just
dreaming as we rode along?

38
00:02:20,990 --> 00:02:24,160
Or without realizing it...

39
00:02:24,160 --> 00:02:26,700
...d- d-did we all just die?

40
00:02:26,700 --> 00:02:27,830
Calm down!

41
00:02:27,830 --> 00:02:28,870
Calm down?

42
00:02:28,870 --> 00:02:31,250
How the hell are we going to calm down?

43
00:02:31,250 --> 00:02:32,000
Quiet!

44
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:35,500
Everyone, compose yourselves!

45
00:02:35,500 --> 00:02:37,300
Forget about what you can't understand!

46
00:02:37,720 --> 00:02:39,220
Focus on what you can do!

47
00:02:39,630 --> 00:02:41,640
Everyone, make a tight formation!

48
00:02:41,640 --> 00:02:43,390
No one is to stray from the group!

49
00:02:43,390 --> 00:02:45,260
Guts, get Griffith on your horse!

50
00:02:45,260 --> 00:02:46,270
Got it!

51
00:02:48,430 --> 00:02:50,390
Hurry up, over there!

52
00:02:51,190 --> 00:02:53,230
Even under these circumstances...

53
00:02:53,230 --> 00:02:55,070
She's one hell of a woman.

54
00:02:55,650 --> 00:02:57,530
All right, Griffith, here we go.

55
00:02:59,860 --> 00:03:02,160
What is this doing here?

56
00:03:02,870 --> 00:03:06,540
I know for sure Griffith didn't
have it when we rescued him.

57
00:03:08,250 --> 00:03:10,080
And it's such a strange shape...

58
00:03:16,380 --> 00:03:17,500
Griffith.

59
00:03:18,380 --> 00:03:20,380
The time has come...

60
00:03:20,930 --> 00:03:24,260
Time for the great festival of darkness...

61
00:03:26,260 --> 00:03:31,640
The banquet that happens
only once every 216 years...

62
00:03:31,640 --> 00:03:33,650
The Great Eclipse!

63
00:03:33,900 --> 00:03:35,480
Where did they come from...

64
00:03:36,190 --> 00:03:38,280
What the hell are they?

65
00:03:38,570 --> 00:03:40,240
They are coming...

66
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:42,490
They are near...

67
00:03:42,490 --> 00:03:45,820
The rulers of the supreme beings...

68
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:50,290
It is the advent of the four guardian angels!

69
00:04:38,790 --> 00:04:39,840
What the...

70
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:41,300
What is it?

71
00:04:41,630 --> 00:04:42,880
A giant?

72
00:05:17,960 --> 00:05:19,880
One after the other...

73
00:05:19,880 --> 00:05:20,960
I'm dreaming...

74
00:05:20,960 --> 00:05:22,590
This has to be a dream!

75
00:05:24,090 --> 00:05:25,590
What now?

76
00:06:07,880 --> 00:06:09,720
What the hell is going on?

77
00:06:10,220 --> 00:06:13,180
It is now time for the great blessing.

78
00:06:14,560 --> 00:06:17,060
We thank you all for gathering here...

79
00:06:17,060 --> 00:06:19,900
...in this sacred time and
place for the final chapter.

80
00:06:21,110 --> 00:06:25,530
O unholy lambs, children of man...

81
00:06:25,940 --> 00:06:30,660
Come and enjoy this divine banquet...

82
00:06:32,570 --> 00:06:34,990
Chosen by the laws of causality...

83
00:06:34,990 --> 00:06:36,540
Our Apostle, our Hawk!

84
00:06:36,540 --> 00:06:38,710
You are the appointed one.

85
00:06:39,460 --> 00:06:42,080
Here in this place, in this moment...

86
00:06:42,540 --> 00:06:46,260
You who have been
chosen by the hand of God.

87
00:06:46,590 --> 00:06:48,920
You, our kin.

88
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:51,300
Our long-awaited blessed king!

89
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:57,720
Griffith?

90
00:06:58,230 --> 00:06:59,600
Kin?

91
00:07:00,310 --> 00:07:01,690
Griffith is a...

92
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:05,270
Cut the crap!

93
00:07:05,270 --> 00:07:08,780
First you drag us
to this godforsaken place...

94
00:07:08,780 --> 00:07:10,530
And now you think you're going
to have your way with him?

95
00:07:11,110 --> 00:07:12,360
Apostle?

96
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:13,620
Kin?

97
00:07:13,620 --> 00:07:15,120
Don't be ridiculous!

98
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:18,450
There's not one shred of him
that resembles the likes of you!

99
00:07:18,450 --> 00:07:21,250
How dare you say
he's one of you monsters!

100
00:07:21,250 --> 00:07:22,080
Guts!

101
00:07:29,670 --> 00:07:32,180
What a beautiful friendship.

102
00:07:32,430 --> 00:07:37,180
You will certainly be
an excellent living sacrificial offering...

103
00:07:37,510 --> 00:07:38,680
A living sacrifice?

104
00:07:41,060 --> 00:07:41,850
Yes.

105
00:07:42,140 --> 00:07:45,650
The precious living sacrifice needed
for him to become a demon king.

106
00:07:46,060 --> 00:07:47,400
Demon king...

107
00:07:47,400 --> 00:07:48,570
Living sacrifice?

108
00:07:48,860 --> 00:07:50,530
Exactly.

109
00:07:50,530 --> 00:07:54,820
From the moment you took
hold of the Crimson Behelit...

110
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:58,740
...you became deserving
of the title demon king.

111
00:07:59,750 --> 00:08:03,000
In fact, it is because
you inherently possessed...

112
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:05,710
...the requirements
that it fell into your hands.

113
00:08:05,710 --> 00:08:10,670
And the fact you used
the behelit to summon us...

114
00:08:10,670 --> 00:08:14,510
...is proof that you are
entitled to become one of us.

115
00:08:14,890 --> 00:08:19,850
All the corpses that have
gathered here have used behelits...

116
00:08:19,850 --> 00:08:23,640
...to take on the forms
they were destined to assume.

117
00:08:24,060 --> 00:08:25,690
You don't mean that...

118
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:28,980
All of you are really...

119
00:08:29,440 --> 00:08:34,400
And the behelit you hold in
your hand is no ordinary behelit!

120
00:08:34,740 --> 00:08:36,700
The Crimson Behelit falls...

121
00:08:36,700 --> 00:08:40,620
...only into the hands of us guardian
angels, those destined to become...

122
00:08:40,620 --> 00:08:42,160
...members of the God Hand.

123
00:08:43,210 --> 00:08:45,040
The Egg of the King.

124
00:08:47,880 --> 00:08:51,130
And all of you are here to serve
as living sacrificial offerings...

125
00:08:51,550 --> 00:08:54,090
...for the christening of this angel...

126
00:09:28,920 --> 00:09:33,340
You're saying that you will transform
Griffith into one of these beasts?

127
00:09:33,760 --> 00:09:36,090
In exchange for our lives?

128
00:09:36,090 --> 00:09:38,260
Not quite.

129
00:09:38,260 --> 00:09:40,100
It will be his will, not ours.

130
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:43,430
It is he who will offer you as living sacrifices...

131
00:09:47,520 --> 00:09:49,440
That's impossible...

132
00:09:49,860 --> 00:09:51,110
It's impossible.

133
00:09:51,440 --> 00:09:54,570
It is all fixed in the flow of causality...

134
00:09:55,150 --> 00:09:57,610
His fate was decided long ago.

135
00:09:57,610 --> 00:10:00,660
Your lives were all destined to come
together at this sacred moment...

136
00:10:00,660 --> 00:10:04,330
...the sacrificial ceremony.

137
00:10:04,330 --> 00:10:07,250
We will now begin the baptism ceremony.

138
00:10:07,250 --> 00:10:09,210
Bring him to the altar!

139
00:10:12,630 --> 00:10:13,630
What the...

140
00:10:27,850 --> 00:10:28,940
Guts!

141
00:10:28,940 --> 00:10:30,060
Griffith!

142
00:11:19,570 --> 00:11:21,410
Baptism!

143
00:11:21,410 --> 00:11:22,530
Baptism!

144
00:11:23,030 --> 00:11:24,740
Baptism!

145
00:11:24,740 --> 00:11:26,370
Baptism!

146
00:11:26,370 --> 00:11:27,490
Baptism!

147
00:11:42,010 --> 00:11:43,970
Are you afraid?

148
00:11:43,970 --> 00:11:45,510
Of us?

149
00:11:46,100 --> 00:11:49,310
Of those who are infinitely
more powerful than you?

150
00:11:49,310 --> 00:11:51,850
Of our almighty power?

151
00:11:52,190 --> 00:11:53,480
Or are you afraid of what lies ahead?

152
00:11:53,980 --> 00:11:57,900
Before we venture into the future,
let us travel back once more...

153
00:11:58,280 --> 00:12:00,690
...to the landscape of your past...

154
00:12:00,690 --> 00:12:02,950
And by doing that,
you shall see the truth.

155
00:12:02,950 --> 00:12:05,620
And see exactly what it is you are...

156
00:12:10,500 --> 00:12:11,330
What?

157
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:14,250
Did everyone go home?

158
00:12:14,790 --> 00:12:17,670
We all said we were
going to see the castle.

159
00:12:19,090 --> 00:12:20,260
Oh well...

160
00:12:20,260 --> 00:12:21,470
I'll go by myself.

161
00:12:30,640 --> 00:12:33,270
Hey, where am I?

162
00:12:33,270 --> 00:12:34,480
I think I'm lost.

163
00:12:35,150 --> 00:12:36,610
Hey, old lady.

164
00:12:36,610 --> 00:12:37,940
Which way is the castle?

165
00:12:40,570 --> 00:12:41,690
This way?

166
00:12:42,990 --> 00:12:44,070
Thank you.

167
00:12:44,860 --> 00:12:46,320
Yes, yes.

168
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:49,870
Your friends went ahead.
They'll be waiting.

169
00:13:05,800 --> 00:13:08,970
I think I've ended up
somewhere I shouldn't be.

170
00:13:09,760 --> 00:13:11,560
Hey, anybody there?

171
00:13:24,950 --> 00:13:27,530
What a noisy child!

172
00:13:28,280 --> 00:13:30,280
Old lady, it's horrible!

173
00:13:30,660 --> 00:13:32,660
There are so many dead people...

174
00:13:32,660 --> 00:13:33,830
I know...

175
00:13:33,830 --> 00:13:35,330
You know?

176
00:13:35,330 --> 00:13:37,420
That's terrible.
You knew, and you lied to me.

177
00:13:37,420 --> 00:13:39,040
I didn't lie.

178
00:13:39,630 --> 00:13:43,130
This is the only path
that leads to the castle.

179
00:13:43,510 --> 00:13:44,550
The only path...

180
00:13:44,880 --> 00:13:50,300
Those heading toward that castle
must either trample over the fallen...

181
00:13:50,300 --> 00:13:54,520
...or else become one of them too.
It's one or the other!

182
00:13:54,890 --> 00:13:57,940
See here. It's your friend!

183
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:05,820
Y-You're...

184
00:14:06,700 --> 00:14:10,370
You're going to the castle
to become king, aren't you?

185
00:14:10,660 --> 00:14:11,950
You're amazing!

186
00:14:12,530 --> 00:14:14,870
I want to be a knight one day...

187
00:14:14,870 --> 00:14:15,540
See?

188
00:14:16,540 --> 00:14:17,330
Hey...

189
00:14:18,160 --> 00:14:20,540
Take me with you.

190
00:14:20,540 --> 00:14:22,170
I'll give you this if you do.

191
00:14:22,840 --> 00:14:25,550
I promise I'll work hard.

192
00:14:25,550 --> 00:14:26,670
All right?

193
00:14:27,880 --> 00:14:29,220
No...

194
00:14:29,220 --> 00:14:29,890
What?

195
00:14:29,890 --> 00:14:30,890
Why not?

196
00:14:31,890 --> 00:14:33,310
I can't...

197
00:14:33,310 --> 00:14:36,140
Because you're already...

198
00:14:37,730 --> 00:14:39,600
You're already dead...

199
00:14:39,900 --> 00:14:42,980
Take us with you too...

200
00:14:42,980 --> 00:14:45,530
We want to fight with you...

201
00:14:45,940 --> 00:14:48,530
I have faith that you can
make it to the castle...

202
00:14:48,950 --> 00:14:51,910
I would love to see
the empire you'll build...

203
00:14:52,280 --> 00:14:55,490
I want to fight under your flag...

204
00:14:56,450 --> 00:14:57,450
No...

205
00:14:57,750 --> 00:14:58,830
I can't...

206
00:14:58,830 --> 00:15:00,170
I can't take you with me...

207
00:15:00,500 --> 00:15:02,330
You're all dead...

208
00:15:02,670 --> 00:15:04,840
None of you are alive anymore!

209
00:15:04,840 --> 00:15:08,920
That's why I can't take
any of you to the castle!

210
00:15:11,010 --> 00:15:13,640
I'm sorry... I'm so sorry...

211
00:15:13,640 --> 00:15:16,390
My, my... what a silly child you are!

212
00:15:16,770 --> 00:15:21,060
After all, you're the one
who did this to all these people!

213
00:15:21,730 --> 00:15:23,560
Isn't that so?

214
00:15:23,560 --> 00:15:26,360
They ended up this way because
they were following your lead.

215
00:15:26,360 --> 00:15:29,280
If you hadn't said that
you wanted to venture up there...

216
00:15:29,280 --> 00:15:31,820
...then none of this would have happened.

217
00:15:32,280 --> 00:15:33,530
But...

218
00:15:33,910 --> 00:15:36,620
I never forced anyone to come along...

219
00:15:36,620 --> 00:15:39,000
Oh, what a thing to say!

220
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:42,960
How do you think
you were able to come this far?

221
00:15:43,460 --> 00:15:44,630
Listen now!

222
00:15:44,630 --> 00:15:46,420
This path that you've chosen...

223
00:15:46,420 --> 00:15:49,460
...is paved with those people's bodies.

224
00:15:49,800 --> 00:15:51,470
And that's not all.

225
00:15:51,470 --> 00:15:54,680
Those people have piled
on several times more bodies...

226
00:15:54,680 --> 00:15:56,470
...than just the ones you started with...

227
00:15:56,470 --> 00:15:58,930
...so that you could get
where you are now.

228
00:15:59,770 --> 00:16:01,640
There, take a look...

229
00:16:02,140 --> 00:16:05,650
If you're to make it
all the way to the castle...

230
00:16:05,650 --> 00:16:09,610
...you'll need to pave your path
with more and more bodies!

231
00:16:10,940 --> 00:16:12,070
What's wrong?

232
00:16:12,070 --> 00:16:13,780
Are you scared now?

233
00:16:14,240 --> 00:16:16,570
Do you want to turn back now?

234
00:16:17,030 --> 00:16:19,490
You can't think like that!

235
00:16:19,490 --> 00:16:21,750
If you succumb to your fears...

236
00:16:21,750 --> 00:16:24,540
...you'll end up as one
of those bodies yourself!

237
00:16:26,670 --> 00:16:29,800
Look closely now at your own hands.

238
00:16:34,840 --> 00:16:36,510
My hands!

239
00:16:36,510 --> 00:16:38,260
What a silly boy!

240
00:16:38,850 --> 00:16:41,180
If you were going to regret your actions...

241
00:16:41,180 --> 00:16:43,270
...you never should've
come here in the first place.

242
00:16:43,560 --> 00:16:46,520
Things are not easy here, you know!

243
00:16:47,520 --> 00:16:52,690
Why couldn't you be satisfied with just
gazing at the castle from the alleyway?

244
00:16:58,580 --> 00:16:59,830
I had no...

245
00:17:00,080 --> 00:17:02,040
I had no idea!

246
00:17:02,040 --> 00:17:03,370
Be quiet!

247
00:17:03,370 --> 00:17:06,620
You must have known
what kind of place this was!

248
00:17:12,130 --> 00:17:13,670
Yes, I've known...

249
00:17:13,670 --> 00:17:14,920
...all along...

250
00:17:15,260 --> 00:17:17,220
...and walked all over them...

251
00:17:17,930 --> 00:17:19,010
...to get here...

252
00:17:20,720 --> 00:17:22,520
What's holding you back
after all this time?

253
00:17:25,690 --> 00:17:28,860
This is the path that leads
to your dream, isn't it?

254
00:17:29,690 --> 00:17:31,400
That's what you believe, right?

255
00:17:31,860 --> 00:17:34,150
So what's causing you to hesitate now?

256
00:17:35,280 --> 00:17:37,450
That's right. Pile them up even higher!

257
00:17:37,450 --> 00:17:39,280
It's not too late.

258
00:17:39,280 --> 00:17:41,740
You have no other choice!

259
00:17:41,740 --> 00:17:46,080
Before you become one of them,
go forth and pile up more bodies!

260
00:17:50,790 --> 00:17:51,460
Yes.

261
00:17:53,510 --> 00:17:55,670
What is the point of regretting anything?

262
00:17:56,550 --> 00:17:58,590
What is the use of repenting my sins?

263
00:18:00,890 --> 00:18:03,220
What can I possibly say
to those who have died?

264
00:18:04,350 --> 00:18:06,480
I cannot apologize to them now.

265
00:18:07,390 --> 00:18:08,390
This is...

266
00:18:09,150 --> 00:18:11,900
...the path that I have chosen.

267
00:18:12,150 --> 00:18:17,530
If I regret my actions or seek
atonement, then it's all over.

268
00:18:18,660 --> 00:18:22,580
And I will never reach my destined goal...

269
00:18:24,450 --> 00:18:25,790
Yes.

270
00:18:25,790 --> 00:18:28,040
That is who you are.

271
00:18:29,500 --> 00:18:30,790
An illusion?

272
00:18:30,790 --> 00:18:32,790
Not an illusion.

273
00:18:32,790 --> 00:18:35,760
It is the reality in your consciousness.

274
00:18:36,170 --> 00:18:37,880
Reaching for the castle in the heavens...

275
00:18:37,880 --> 00:18:41,720
Stacking bodies to reach
the highest summit is your destiny.

276
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:45,100
Stepping on thousands
of your comrades' bodies...

277
00:18:45,100 --> 00:18:49,690
...and tens of thousands of bodies
your comrades paved for you in turn.

278
00:18:49,690 --> 00:18:54,730
All while disregarding who or what
they were, you trampled your way here!

279
00:18:55,190 --> 00:18:57,690
You carried only
one thought in your mind.

280
00:18:58,400 --> 00:19:02,490
And now you have
reached the end of the path.

281
00:19:03,320 --> 00:19:04,740
Look around...

282
00:19:06,160 --> 00:19:10,370
This is your gift, here at the final
destination of your bloody journey.

283
00:19:11,370 --> 00:19:14,380
All of the hawk wings that
have accompanied you in flight...

284
00:19:14,380 --> 00:19:16,130
Each pair of wings...

285
00:19:16,630 --> 00:19:18,840
Surely they will forgive you...

286
00:19:19,760 --> 00:19:23,050
Even if they are racked
by despair at this moment...

287
00:19:23,050 --> 00:19:26,100
They will welcome you with open arms...

288
00:19:27,100 --> 00:19:30,020
And you shall live on...

289
00:19:30,390 --> 00:19:32,850
Entrust your wounded body to them...

290
00:19:33,860 --> 00:19:36,110
Leave your past behind...

291
00:19:37,280 --> 00:19:39,940
And bury yourself
in the ruins of your dreams.

292
00:19:42,200 --> 00:19:43,320
The ruins...

293
00:19:43,700 --> 00:19:45,160
...of my dreams...

294
00:19:45,160 --> 00:19:49,540
That is the divine
punishment created by man.

295
00:19:51,250 --> 00:19:53,670
But if your dream is still alive...

296
00:19:54,170 --> 00:19:58,590
If that castle still dazzles you more
than anything else in this world...

297
00:19:58,920 --> 00:20:03,640
You must stack the remaining
stones that surround you...

298
00:20:04,090 --> 00:20:05,930
Let us chant...

299
00:20:06,260 --> 00:20:07,680
This we offer.

300
00:20:08,560 --> 00:20:13,060
Hesitation will not let the black wings
fly from mountain top to the heavens.

301
00:20:14,600 --> 00:20:17,230
Fate is beyond human understanding...

302
00:20:17,230 --> 00:20:21,070
If the laws of causality dictate
that man is only to be toyed with...

303
00:20:21,070 --> 00:20:24,070
...then his child must confront
his destiny by embracing evil.

304
00:20:24,410 --> 00:20:25,450
Griffith!

305
00:20:37,880 --> 00:20:38,800
Yes...

306
00:20:39,250 --> 00:20:43,680
Out of all the thousands of comrades
and tens of thousands of enemies.

307
00:20:44,090 --> 00:20:45,470
Only one...

308
00:20:47,010 --> 00:20:49,430
You and you alone...

309
00:20:55,100 --> 00:20:57,520
You made me forget my dream.

310
00:20:59,360 --> 00:21:01,530
I offer them all...

311
00:21:08,320 --> 00:21:09,700
Griffith!

312
00:21:09,990 --> 00:21:14,960
The threads of causality
are now bound together...

313
00:21:14,960 --> 00:21:17,420
The promised hour is now here!

314
00:22:03,390 --> 00:22:05,850
Looking back, the morning comes.

315
00:22:05,850 --> 00:22:09,350
Don't find your face in your glass.

316
00:22:10,390 --> 00:22:13,480
Take the moonlight by the tail.

317
00:22:13,480 --> 00:22:16,440
It's a rainy sight. You're shading.

318
00:22:17,900 --> 00:22:19,650
What is that?

319
00:22:19,650 --> 00:22:20,900
It's just the same.

320
00:22:20,900 --> 00:22:24,070
What is trying your crown?

321
00:22:25,160 --> 00:22:28,370
I'm spending my glass, walking back.

322
00:22:28,370 --> 00:22:31,410
So wear my glass. You're fading.

323
00:22:31,710 --> 00:22:51,310
I'm waiting so long.

324
00:22:51,310 --> 00:23:00,400
I'm waiting...

